WEBVTT

00:10:29.036 --> 00:10:30.316
She invested in her life.

00:10:30.356 --> 00:10:32.156
She had a lot of fun.

00:10:33.116 --> 00:10:35.756
You all remember
the party you were at with Trudy.

00:10:35.756 --> 00:10:39.156
And she invested in the local school,
community, friends and family.

00:10:39.476 --> 00:10:41.916
For Planet, she was also a one.

00:10:41.916 --> 00:10:43.836
She had a very low carbon footprint.

00:10:43.876 --> 00:10:45.556
She very rarely flew anywhere.

00:10:45.596 --> 00:10:46.836
She didn't own a car.

00:10:46.836 --> 00:10:49.716
She was avid at reduce, reuse, recycle.

00:10:50.196 --> 00:10:51.396
And in winter,

00:10:51.396 --> 00:10:53.076
she would make you put a jumper on

00:10:53.076 --> 00:10:55.156
before she'd let you turn the heating on.

00:10:55.596 --> 00:10:58.556
And on Purpose,
she was also a strong one.

00:10:59.036 --> 00:11:01.276
She knew the legacy
she wanted to leave behind.